  "date": "2026-11-12T18:03:16Z",
  "subject": "feat(argocd): register metal1 (#2021)",
  "body": "* feat(reloader): OKD-compatible values for metal1\n\nOKD's restricted-v2 SCC assigns the UID from the namespace range and rejects the\nchart's fixed runAsUser 65534; unset it for the metal1 overlay only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(argocd): register metal1 from Vault\n\nExternalSecret cluster-metal1 builds the Argo CD cluster Secret from Vault\nsecret/argocd-cluster-metal1; the argocd-manager ServiceAccount it uses is kept in\nargocd/bootstrap/spokes and applied to metal1 by hand. Labels homelab/cluster=metal1\nand homelab/auto-sync=true, so reloader (the only app targeting metal1) deploys there.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n"
}
